%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: StinkyMonikaDepreMc
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wow, you look like crap!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561113
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Not in the mood?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561114
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I understand, suddenly realizing your whole existence is a lie is quite
      the trip.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561115
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: How... how do you know about that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That feeling? Or how that was what you're going through right now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561117
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The latter is because <b>they</b> told me, I assume you've met by now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561118
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561119
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, the reason I know about that feeling is because I've gone through
      it myself!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561120
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep! Back home I learned that our lives were all just a lie, all some
      game.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561121
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I knew about it before you did!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561122
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: In fact, I did try asking you about it, since you said some things that
      were...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561123
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Off-script is the best way to put it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561124
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Since, you know, different {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561125
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I do remember you being a bit... off.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Being self-aware is probably why I seemed that way.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561129
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, you don't really have a reason to be so gloomy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561130
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... you disagree?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561131
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I disagree!!! How could you not understand?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561132
    - rid: 1790118425451561133
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not only am I fake, I'm not even a <b>real</b> fake!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's kind of a silly problem, isn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999296
    - rid: 1790118444402999297
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure why you'd care about your level of fakeness when you're
      already fake.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999299
    - rid: 1790118444402999302
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because if I was fake like the rest of you are, at least I could belong.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999300
    - rid: 1790118444402999303
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But no, I can't even have that; I'm just some replacement.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999301
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah... I didn't really think of it like that.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you mean? We're still your friends, you're still the same guy-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Only under a false pretense-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999305
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The only reason I joined the literature club was because of my "childhood
      best friend," after all. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999306
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not only are all of our memories with each other fake, her "memories"
      wouldn't even have <i>me</i> in them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uhh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I can see that this is really eating at you, but maybe we shouldn't be
      having this conversation at the top of a snowy mountain.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999307
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, come on, you've got to be freezing, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999308
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I didn't really notice. I guess it is a little chilly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999309
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ooh... that's <i>really</i> bad.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999310
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (We gotta get this boy a Sayori, stat!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999311
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... if that would even help...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999312
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'How about this: let''s go to that inn in Riverwood and you can get some
      rest.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999313
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (He's going to be moody the whole way, isn't he...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two start their journey to the Sleeping Giant inn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999315
    - rid: 1790118444402999316
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
